{
  "_about": "What each kind of push looks like, on a host named Studio Mac: `plaintext` is what the phone opens, exactly, `aps` is what Apple sees, `headers` the APNs headers other than authorization and the token. serve/push/tests.rs drives the real sender to each of these. `expires_in` is apns-expiration minus the send's time. `collapse` says whether apns-collapse-id is present.",
